  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Posil&#x148;ovanie region&#xe1;lnych kapac&#xed;t pre integra&#x10d;n&#xe9; amb&#xed;cie Srbska</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Regional Capacity for Integration Ambitions of Serbia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;Cie&#x13e;om projektu je vzdela&#x165; a vy&#x161;koli&#x165; &#x13e;udsk&#xe9; kapacity obchodn&#xfd;ch kom&#xf4;r a&#xa0;verejn&#xe9;ho sektora, podnikate&#x13e;sk&#xfd;ch organiz&#xe1;ci&#xed; za &#xfa;&#x10d;elom implement&#xe1;ci&#xed; ich nov&#xfd;ch know-how pre podnikate&#x13e;sk&#xe9; prostredie, noriem E&#xda;, reforiem, riadenia verejn&#xe9;ho sektora s cie&#x13e;om pozdvihnutia ich kapac&#xed;t&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project is focused on strengthening the capacities of chambers of commerce, public sector institutions and business organizations for implementation new know-how for the improvement of business environment, implementation of EU legislation and standards, reform of public sector governance.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
